WEBVTT

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:39.030
So, I should give this to Provincial Governor Kou?

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:41.660
I'm trusting it to you, Kai-dono.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.870
I shall do as you requested.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:52.670
Shuurei...

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.680
The long winter was coming to an end.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:11.650
Shuurei, who had become a joukan, would be returning to Kiyou soon.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.650
Really, he's a nuisance.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.530
I understand he's worried about Eigetsu-sama, but he's always sticking to him.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.080
I'd like to be next to Eigetsu-sama like that.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.910
Eigetsu-sama asked me to stay with him forever, but...

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.720
Seriously, Ryuuren-sama.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.270
Shuurei-sama? What are you doing?

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.730
Kourin.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.980
I thought I'd learn about Sashuu's vegetable dishes.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.110
The people I met in Sashuu, the things that happened,

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:00.320
the days I spent here, and the promises I made.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.490
I don't want to forget any of that.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.200
So I think I'll learn as much as I can before I leave.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.750
Then, I'm going to cook loads of dishes and invite people to try them.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.500
That's splendid!

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:18.920
So you're treating everyone to a meal?

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.130
Kourin, will you come with me to shop for food tomorrow?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.890
With pleasure!

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.510
We'll gladly come with you, my soul friend.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:30.430
S-Seriously, Ryuuren-san, will you put me down?

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.310
Let me be your guide.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.040
Hey, why are we hiking up the mountain?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.040
Weren't we supposed to be shopping for food?

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.090
I don't understand what you're saying!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.420
On the way to go shopping, we'll visit Sashuu sites of scenic beauty and historic interest.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:02.340
What?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.390
Well, just let it go, Shuurei-san.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.890
That's right, oujo-sama.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:16.020
Ryuuren-bocchan wants you to enjoy yourself too... probably.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:18.650
You think so?

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:27.740
Now take a look at this, the view from
Sashuu's greatest mountain, Mount Ko!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.870
Really, a fantastic view.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.710
Just look at it with your mind's eye.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.880
Ah, it's a grand site to my eyes.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.380
Would you like me to push you over?!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.390
K-Kourin-san...

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:52.140
What is it?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.390
Oujo-sama, please stand back.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.360
Oh!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.530
What's this?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.740
Shourin-kun! Youshun-kun!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.740
Everyone, what an unexpected encounter!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:13.700
Hmm?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.370
Impressive. You have good sense.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.420
Master's praise is the highest of honors!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.130
Anyway, what are you two doing here?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:27.130
We were collecting wild plants as we were exercising!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.590
Wild plants?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.300
Wow, this is amazing!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.060
Shuurei-san, we should go and collect them too!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.150
It seems we can get most of the ingredients without shopping for them.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.400
If you want, you can have these.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.440
What, really?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.530
We, who rob the rich to help the poor, never lie!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.030
Thank you!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.530
Oh, come to think of it, why don't you come to our residence tomorrow?

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.410
I'm planning to cook lots of dishes.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.740
Really?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.870
Boss, let's accept the inviting cat!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.830
You idiot! What are we supposed to do by accepting the cat's invitation?

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:05.050
However, if we decline your kindness, it will ruin the reputation of Vulture the Robber.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.340
We accept your invitation with gratitude.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:12.470
In that case, tomorrow morning, we'll bring heaps of mountain herbs as a return present,

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.100
and meat as well!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.020
Well, then!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.310
See you!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.860
It looks like we don't need to go shopping after all.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.270
Yeah.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:29.280
Okay then, let's go sightseeing with no chores to worry us,

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.280
my soul friends and their friends.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.410
Okay, okay.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.540
Have you seen the legendary ancient fish to your heart's content?

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.920
I never dreamed that fishes like that could live in the lake.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:44.840
That was a shock.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.760
I thought I'd die.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.340
I'll guide you to the cave next.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.350
Is there a cave in the middle of town?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:59.100
Supposedly the ghost of a woman abandoned by her lover haunts that place and cries audibly.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.270
A ghost? Is this really sightseeing?

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.900
It's not something you get to see every day.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.990
This place really looks haunted.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.530
It's eerie and damp...

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.700
Isn't this cave elegant?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.120
Now, let's go in.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.590
Oh, my soul friend! Are you all right?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:35.600
Ah, thank you.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.230
Wha... Hey!

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.440
Come on, let's hurry.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.310
Don't pull so suddenly!

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.900
Thank you, Ryuuren-san.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.860
They get along so well.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.070
Should I hold your hand too, Princess?

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.320
No, thank you.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.080
It was a good idea to refuse, oujo-sama.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.160
Otherwise, your hands will get dirty.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.620
I do wash them, you know.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.130
You can really hear the crying...

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.800
Someone's there.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.980
Could it really be... a ghost?

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:25.940
Isn't that Kokujun?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:26.940
Huh?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.150
I'm only...

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:31.400
I'm just a...

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.910
Always getting in Shunki's way.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.410
Shunki can get the work done faster than me.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.740
How shameful.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.540
If I stay like this, she'll leave me!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.630
Oh, everyone.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.090
It's been a while.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.170
Shunki-san!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.130
Please wait a second.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:01.310
Kokujun-sama, your time for being depressed is over for today.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.730
Now, now, let's get back to work.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:10.770
If you finish your work sooner, we get to spend more time as husband and wife.

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:12.780
Spending time with just the two of us.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.450
You're right! Okay, I'm gonna do my best!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.160
I'll get the work done quickly and be with Shunki!

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:23.370
My dear Kokujun-sama...

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.960
Kokujun is still a man after all.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.710
Oh, yes... Shunki-san, about tomorrow...

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:42.680
Ensei-san!

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:55.360
Take this!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.410
Here I come!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.620
There!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.120
I'm tired from being dragged around.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:10.790
But it was fun.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.170
That's true. Thanks, Ryuuren.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.150
Just the right flavor.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.240
It's delicious!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.950
It tastes great!

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:12.150
The day before Shuurei was to leave Sashuu, the new Governor of Sashuu, Kai Yu, arrived in Koren.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:20.200
I've made you worry this time.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:26.160
You should not make your elders worry so much.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:29.500
What you did this time was a little thoughtless.

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:32.370
I have no excuse.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.210
I said "a little."

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.840
If you are going to be reckless, there are ways to do it.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:42.260
I will teach you how, step by step.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:49.310
I will pass on to you everything that I have learned as an official.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.020
Will you accept it?

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:53.520
Yes!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.110
I look forward to your guidance!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:05.120
Governor Kou, I shall protect what you have protected.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.910
That was our promise, wasn't it?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.410
Governor Kai...

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.570
I always keep a promise that I have made to a lady.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:17.920
I swear this to you again.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:26.470
You two have worked so hard, plowing and sowing in Sashuu.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:32.230
I swear to you that I will nurture all of the things you have grown with such great care.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:38.360
Oh yes, I have something to give to you, Governor Kou.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:13:00.000
Yuushun-dono, can I trust our Emperor to you?

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:05.010
Yes, I will accept the appointment to be Prime Minister.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.180
It is an important duty. You must stay beside the Emperor and support him.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:15.890
Are you prepared to believe in him and to support him, even if you are the only person to do so?

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:20.730
Yes. We officials are here to make ideals into reality.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:22.190
Besides...

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:23.570
Besides?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.160
I'm confident that I won't become the only person,

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.910
and that I'd do something about it before it got that far.

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:35.410
You have grown to be a very dependable man.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.750
Well, I am relying on you.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.430
Is something wrong, oujo-sama?

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.440
No, it's nothing. Let's have tea.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.610
It's Kanro tea, isn't it? Thank you.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.490
I thought we'd better have it while we're still in Sashuu.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.410
Hey, Seiran...

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.950
Lots of things have happened, don't you think?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.330
Too many, really.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.790
Thanks for tagging along all the time.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:20.880
Not at all.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.500
I've got to start over again.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.300
It's unbelievable how my official rank goes up and down.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.880
I think it's good. It gives you a sense of satisfaction.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:39.600
I wonder if I can help Ryuuki even a tiny bit at my lowly rank.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.860
Yes, a lot.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.820
Is that so? Then that's okay.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.740
I will return to the capital too.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:54.910
Okay.

00:14:55.790 --> 00:15:00.370
Yuushun, thanks for all your help up till now.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.460
I'll be there, beyond Shuurei-dono.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.840
Do your best. I'll be waiting.

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:12.220
How did you know?

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.050
Please pass the national exam as soon as possible.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.970
Let's meet again in Kiyou, Ensei.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.940
Well, I'll do my best and get there somehow.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:28.360
Hey, Yuushun. Did I manage to do a good job as a provincial governor?

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:32.490
Do you think I met Enjun-jii-chan's expectations?

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.830
This city is the answer.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.710
I respect you from my heart, Rou Ensei.

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:04.190
It feels like I received this a long time ago.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.190
Please don't forget...

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:15.110
He'll always wait, honoring my wishes.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.290
I'll be waiting for you...

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:28.000
Hey, Ryuuki, you're too kind.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:38.720
Shuurei-sama said she wanted to learn the dishes of Sashuu for...

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:54.490
Shuurei-sama, I've realized something.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:17:01.580
A strong woman can take whatever path she wants, however she wishes.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.670
Men will come after you on their own.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:12.420
If they're really serious about it,
they'll die to find a way to possess you.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:16.760
So Shuurei-sama can stay just the way she is.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:21.180
I too will do my best, so that my man will be dying for me.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:34.070
Ryuuren-sama! Shouldn't you leave Eigetsu-sama alone?!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.190
You're bothering him!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.070
Kourin-san, I don't really find this...

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.700
Then you should stick to us.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.370
Um, Ryuuren-san?

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:50.130
Don't be modest. Let's stick to my soul friend number two, Eigetsu, together.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.210
My soul friend number two's soul friend.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:56.720
Th-Then I'll be next to him together with...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.470
Seriously?

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.970
Of course I can't do that!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:04.270
Just... get... away... from... him!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:08.310
Seriously! You're always, always getting in the way!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.020
Um, Kourin-san?

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:09.850
Stay away from him!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.370
Kourin, thanks for everything.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.170
Good luck with Eigetsu-kun.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.880
Sh-Shuurei-sama!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:40.430
Eigetsu-kun, thanks for staying with me until now.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.430
That's something I should say to you.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:50.440
No. Really, really, thanks a lot, Eigetsu-kun!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.360
If anything happens, please call me.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:55.650
I'll fly to you.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.650
I'll fly to you too!

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:00.820
I always have wings on my heart.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:06.450
My soul friend, if there's trouble, call my name to the sky!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.540
Thanks, Ryuuren.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.750
In that case, fly away to the ends of this world.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.670
It's goodbye again then, Ensei.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.130
Yeah, all the best to you.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.220
Eat well, and sleep properly!

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:23.470
A word like "sentimental" doesn't really suit you, does it?

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.600
Do your best. I will too.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.690
All the best to you too.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.360
And to you.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:50.660
Oujo-sama.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.420
Seiran, stop the carriage.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.460
Shuurei-onee-chan!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.420
Shuuran...

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.430
She wouldn't listen to us. She said,
"I'm going to say farewell, no matter what."

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.430
Even Mayor Hei?

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.560
Shuurei-onee-chan, thanks for coming.

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:16.360
Thanks for coming to Sekiei Village, to Korin, to Sashuu!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.190
I was really, really happy to see you!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.410
Now I've got something I want to be.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.070
Oh, I know, a doctor?

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.080
No. I'm gonna be an officer!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:38.090
I'll become a government official like you and save people!

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:44.010
I'm gonna study lots and lots, and one day I'll become like you!

00:20:47.090 --> 00:20:48.430
Wait for me until then.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.220
Wait for me, no matter what!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:54.020
I will be this child's guardian.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.190
I promise you that she will pass the national exam with the top grade.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:02.860
Until then, please do your best at the Imperial Court just as you are.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.030
At the Imperial Court... just as I am...

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.370
Onee-chan?

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.120
It's nothing. Thank you, Shuuran.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:19.590
Shuuran and I are very serious about this, Governor Kou.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.510
Then, whatever happens...

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:28.140
I have to do my best until Shuuran comes to the Imperial Court!

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:30.810
That's right! Wait for me, no matter what!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.190
Oujo-sama, over there.

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:05.050
Everyone, thank you!

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:09.180
Goodbye.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:22.270
I'm home, Father!

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:24.150
I have returned too.

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:27.110
Oh, welcome home, Shuurei, Seiran.

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:37.080
Seiran, when you're finished, please clean the kitchen.

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:38.660
Yes, oujo-sama.

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:44.960
Really, how can father make such a mess?

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:47.880
Shuurei, Seiran!

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:55.970
It's almost spring, Shuurei.

00:22:56.810 --> 00:22:58.480
Seasons turn...

00:22:59.190 --> 00:22:59.770
so...

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:03.810
It's all right.

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:06.230
I'm doing fine.

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:16.410
Shuurei...

00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:46.750
I'm home, Father!

00:24:47.040 --> 00:24:50.300
I've got a lot to tell you about Sashuu! Will you listen to my stories?

00:24:50.590 --> 00:24:52.630
I'll cook you vegetable dishes from Sashuu too.

00:24:53.010 --> 00:24:57.050
I wonder if Ryuuki, Ran-shogun, and Kouyuu-sama have been doing well?
